      "en": "「Ngh! To think they're this strong!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g112_00"
    },
    "112:3455": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "56f47fc6e2980adc8232ea1b40b72480647d99ec043bc79c8358e62c74bd3d83",
      "en": "「Are you saying my dark power\\ndoesn't work on that one!?」",
